# ==============================================================================
# SURAKSHA AI — Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: This file contains PLACEHOLDERS ONLY. Do NOT put real secrets or API keys
# into this file. Copy this file to '.env' for local development if needed.
# Ensure '.env' is never committed to version control (verified in .gitignore).
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Gemini AI API Key (Optional / Experimental)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# In Google AI Studio, this key is automatically injected from user secrets.
# If configuring for local external builds, uncomment and set your placeholder:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Release Keystore Signing Configuration (Optional / CI-CD)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required only if building signed release bundles outside AI Studio:
# KEYSTORE_PATH=/path/to/your/upload-keystore.jks
# STORE_PASSWORD=YOUR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD
# KEY_PASSWORD=YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD
